'''Master of Metal''' is a notable [[Ascendancy passive skill]] for the [[Champion]]. It causes {{stl|Impale}} to last 1 additional hit, grants you and nearby allies [[armour]] if you've applied Impale on an enemy in the past 4 seconds, and grants added physical damage to you and nearby allies for each Impale on an enemy.

==Ruthless mode==
