|1         = <div class="passive-icon-container passive-icon-type__ascendancy_notable"><div class="passive-icon-frame"></div>[[File:ImpalePassiveNotable (Champion) passive skill icon.png]]</div>
|2         = Impales you inflict last 1 additional Hit<br>Impale Damage dealt to Enemies Impaled by you ignores Enemy Physical Damage Reduction
}}

Master of Metal in [[Ruthless mode]] does not grant armour or added physical damage, but also causes impale to ignore the enemy's physical damage reduction.

